{
  "key": 25606,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownNorthHouse_Text_LikeToKnowMesprit",
      "en_US": [
        "Where are you from?\r",
        "...\r",
        "Hm, Twinleaf Town, you say.\n",
        "Isn’t that close to Lake Verity?\r",
        "That lake is said to be home to MESPRIT,\n",
        "“The Being of Emotion.”\r",
        "That Pokémon may well be watching\n",
        "over you.\r",
        "Would you like to know more about\n",
        "MESPRIT?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "D’où viens-tu?\r",
        "...\r",
        "Hum, Bonaugure, dis-tu...\n",
        "C’est pas loin du Lac Vérité, non?\r",
        "Il paraît que ce lac est la demeure de\n",
        "CREFOLLET, “être de l’émotion”.\r",
        "Il doit veiller sur toi.\r",
        "Veux-tu que je t’en dise plus sur\n",
        "CREFOLLET?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownNorthHouse_Text_MespritInfo",
      "en_US": [
        "MESPRIT is the legendary Pokémon\n",
        "that symbolizes the emotions.\r",
        "Beside it are also UXIE, “The Being of\n",
        "Knowledge,” and AZELF, “The Being of\f",
        "Willpower.”\r",
        "These three Pokémon are said to have\n",
        "strong and compassionate spirits.\r",
        "The power of their spirits maintains\n",
        "the natural balance of Sinnoh."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "CREFOLLET est le Pokémon légendaire\n",
        "symbolisant les émotions.\r",
        "Il y a aussi CREHELF, “être du savoir”\n",
        "et CREFADET, “être de la volonté”.\r",
        "Ces trois Pokémon sont réputés pour\n",
        "leur force de caractère et leur\f",
        "compassion.\r",
        "Ce sont eux qui maintiennent l’équilibre\n",
        "naturel de Sinnoh."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownNorthHouse_Text_YouWouldnt",
      "en_US": [
        "Hahaha!\n",
        "Well, of course you wouldn’t.\r",
        "It’s a tale from so long ago.\n",
        "It’s no wonder you weren’t interested."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ha, ha, ha!\n",
        "J’aurais dû m’en douter.\r",
        "C’est une très vieille légende. Pas\n",
        "étonnant qu’elle ne t’intéresse pas."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownNorthHouse_Text_UsingSurfGoPlaces",
      "en_US": [
        "Using the move Surf, you’ll be able to\n",
        "go to places that were inaccessible.\r",
        "You’d be surprised where you can go."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Grâce à Surf, tu pourras rejoindre des\n",
        "endroits auparavant inaccessibles.\r",
        "En explorant, tu devrais tomber sur\n",
        "quelques surprises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownNorthHouse_Text_CelesticOldestTown",
      "en_US": [
        "Celestic Town is the oldest town in\n",
        "all of Sinnoh.\r",
        "The town was founded to honor\n",
        "Pokémon from the distant past.\r",
        "Or at least that’s the legend..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Célestia est la ville la plus ancienne\n",
        "de Sinnoh.\r",
        "Elle fut fondée en l’honneur des\n",
        "Pokémon d’un passé lointain.\r",
        "Tout du moins, c’est ce\n",
        "que dit la légende..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownNorthHouse_Text_IDidSomeResearch",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, hello!\n",
        "You look good.\r",
        "I did some research of my own since\n",
        "that spot of trouble last time.\r",
        "Mt. Coronet’s acting up had me very\n",
        "concerned, too.\r",
        "Well, this is what I found in the shrine.\r",
        "It’s a book, and it’s quite old.\n",
        "Let me read a bit for you.\r",
        "“The bearer of the shining Adamant Orb\n",
        "summons DIALGA to the Spear Pillar.\r",
        "“The guardian Pokémon of time will\n",
        "answer the call.\r",
        "“The bearer of the shining Lustrous\n",
        "Orb summons PALKIA to the Spear Pillar.\r",
        "“The Pokémon that binds the spatial\n",
        "dimensions will answer the call.”\r",
        "It seems the people of long ago met\n",
        "both DIALGA and PALKIA, the Pokémon\f",
        "of time and space."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Eh bien, bonjour!\n",
        "Tu as l’air en forme.\r",
        "J’ai mené des recherches dans mon coin\n",
        "depuis les ennuis de la dernière fois.\r",
        "L’activité du Mont Couronné me semble\n",
        "très inquiétante.\r",
        "Enfin, voilà ce que j’ai trouvé\n",
        "dans le temple.\r",
        "C’est un livre et il est assez\n",
        "ancien. Ecoute ce passage.\r",
        "“Que le porteur de l’Orbe Adamant \n",
        "invoque DIALGA aux Colonnes Lances.\r",
        "“Le Pokémon gardien du temps répondra\n",
        "à son appel.\r",
        "“Que le porteur de l’Orbe Perlé invoque\n",
        "PALKIA aux Colonnes Lances.\r",
        "“Le Pokémon qui lie les dimensions\n",
        "spatiales répondra à l’appel.”\r",
        "Il semblerait que les peuples antiques\n",
        "aient connu DIALGA et PALKIA,\f",
        "les Pokémon du temps et de l’espace."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownNorthHouse_Text_PalkiaIsWritten",
      "en_US": [
        "“PALKIA, the Pokémon that binds the\n",
        "spatial dimensions,” it is written...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Il est écrit “PALKIA, le Pokémon qui\n",
        "lie les dimensions spatiales”...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownNorthHouse_Text_DialgaIsWritten",
      "en_US": [
        "“DIALGA, the guardian Pokémon of\n",
        "time,” it is written...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Il est écrit “DIALGA, le Pokémon\n",
        "gardien du temps”...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownNorthHouse_Text_Dummy8",
      "garbage": 63
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownNorthHouse_Text_MySisterStudiesMyths",
      "en_US": [
        "My big sister is studying the myths\n",
        "of Sinnoh.\r",
        "She wants to know how people and\n",
        "Pokémon interacted in the days of\f",
        "myths.\r",
        "Were things different back then?\n",
        "Or were they the same as now?\r",
        "She says that’s the focus of her\n",
        "research."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ma grande sœur étudie les mythes\n",
        "de Sinnoh.\r",
        "Elle cherche à étudier la relation\n",
        "qui liait les gens aux Pokémon\f",
        "dans les temps anciens.\r",
        "Les choses étaient-elles différentes?\n",
        "Ou pareilles qu’aujourd’hui?\r",
        "Selon elle, c’est le point principal\n",
        "de ses recherches."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownNorthHouse_Text_InvaluableScroll",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s hard to tell for sure, but it’s\n",
        "probably an invaluable scroll."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Difficile à dire, mais c’est sûrement\n",
        "un parchemin de grande valeur."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTownNorthHouse_Text_OldBook",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s an old book.\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} began reading it.\r",
        "“When that Pokémon was born,\n",
        "intelligence bloomed among us,\f",
        "enriching our lives.\r",
        "“When that Pokémon was born,\n",
        "emotions bloomed among us,\f",
        "giving us joy and sorrow.\r",
        "“When that Pokémon was born,\n",
        "willpower bloomed among us,\f",
        "spurring us into action...”"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "C’est un vieux livre.\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} commence à le lire.\r",
        "“A la naissance de ce Pokémon,\n",
        "l’intelligence s’est répandue parmi nous\f",
        "pour améliorer notre existence.\r",
        "A la naissance de ce Pokémon,\n",
        "les émotions se sont répandues\f",
        "pour nous donner joie et tristesse.\r",
        "A la naissance de ce Pokémon,\n",
        "la volonté s’est répandue\f",
        "pour nous encourager à agir...”"
      ]
    }
  ]
}